# Generated run output — contains real customer invoices / route data. NEVER commit.
# Deny-by-default on artifact types rather than on one blessed directory name:
# an ad-hoc run written somewhere else (e.g. a fill-in pack for stops added to a
# live route) used to land outside `route_pack_out/` and show up as untracked
# customer PDFs. Only this skill's own source is tracked.
*.pdf
summary.json
summary.md
inventory_proposals.json
scripts/route_pack_out/
route_pack_out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
